      "result_description": "Ladock CC - 1st XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "21575",
      "match_notes": "Roche won the toss and put Ladock into bat, Ladock making a quick start reaching 62-1 off the first 10 overs, before Roche staged a fightback to bowl Ladock out for 121, M Butler top scoring with a quick fire 45 for the visitors, P Trethewey 4-28, D Jeffery 3-16 and J Inch 2-11 with the wickets for Roche.<br>In reply Roche lost wickets quickly, stumbling to 35-5 before some lower order resistance from M Trudgeon (33) brought Roche to within touching distance of victory, only to fall at the final hurdle, being bowled out for 100, M Butler 5-15, V Oza 2-22 and M Bray 2-24 doing the damage with the ball.",
